  "title": "B3 fix round: sync .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md line 1 with the reworded CLAUDE.md on task/T-0744 (gate red on test_planner_md_matches_claude_md_lists)",
  "spec": "Why: B3 (T-0744, commit 474ec48 on branch task/T-0744) reworded CLAUDE.md line 1 as specified, but tests/test_goals.py::PlannerPromptAndConfig::test_planner_md_matches_claude_md_lists requires .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md line 1 to be identical to CLAUDE.md line 1, and planner.md was outside T-0744's scope, so the gate went red. This task continues on the same branch (constraints.fix_round_for = T-0744, so the worktree is cut from task/T-0744) with planner.md in scope.\nWhat: set .orchestrator/prompts/planner.md line 1 to exactly CLAUDE.md line 1 as it stands on task/T-0744 ('# You are the Planner. A human approves every merge to main. Headless Planner launches pick their model through pool.toml [planner.routing] (Fable 5.1 escalation tier, Opus default candidate, shadow until evidence); the interactive session runs the model `orchestrator pick planner --model` names, Fable 5.1 today.'); change nothing else in planner.md (the rest of the file mirrors CLAUDE.md's Never/Always lists already and must keep matching them, so if the test also compares those lists, keep them identical). Re-run .claude/hooks/tests-green.sh and commit. Everything from 474ec48 (cli pick --model, premium_summary interactive_by_goal/accepted_goals, format_premium_summary blocks, CLAUDE.md wording, the four B3 tests) stays.",
  "inputs": [
    "T-0744"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_goals.py::test_planner_md_matches_claude_md_lists \u2014 planner.md line 1 equals CLAUDE.md line 1 and the Never/Always lists still match",
    "tests/test_cli.py::test_pick_planner_model_flag \u2014 `pick planner --model` prints the account line then a model line naming models.planner with a reason containing 'shadow' under the default config, and models.opus with 'active' when [planner.routing].mode is active; `pick planner` without the flag prints exactly the legacy single line",
    "tests/test_planner_runs.py::test_premium_summary_includes_interactive_by_goal_and_accepted_goals \u2014 premium_summary returns both keys and None for a raising helper",
    "tests/test_scorecard.py::test_format_premium_summary_renders_attribution_blocks \u2014 the 'interactive by goal (approximate):' block and the 'accepted goals:' line render when populated and are omitted when None",
    "tests/test_cli.py::test_claude_md_planner_wording \u2014 CLAUDE.md's first line no longer says 'Planner (Fable 5.1)' and mentions [planner.routing] and `orchestrator pick planner --model`"
